## Component Style

- **Buttons**: {{BUTTON_STYLE}}
  (Example: "Filled primary, 12px vertical padding, 24px horizontal, 8px border-radius.
  Ghost buttons for secondary actions. No icon-only buttons without aria-label.")

- **Cards**: {{CARD_STYLE}}
  (Example: "White surface, 24px padding, 8px border-radius, subtle shadow.
  No nested cards. Max 1 primary CTA per card.")

- **Inputs**: {{INPUT_STYLE}}
  (Example: "Outlined with 1px border, 8px border-radius, 12px padding.
  Focus ring: 2px primary color, 2px offset.")

- **Tables**: {{TABLE_STYLE}}
  (Example: "No zebra striping. Row hover with 2% background tint.
  Wrap in overflow-x: auto div on mobile.")

- **Badges/tags**: {{BADGE_STYLE}}
  (Example: "Pill shape (999px radius), 6px vertical padding, 12px horizontal.
  Max 3 badge types per card. Never use color alone to encode meaning.")

## Accessibility

- **Minimum text contrast**: 4.5:1 (WCAG AA)
- **Large text contrast**: 3:1 (text ≥ 18pt or 14pt bold)
- **Focus indicator**: 2px solid primary color, 2px offset, never hidden
- **Motion preference**: Respect `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`

